      },
      "hyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "You must declare goods if they:",
      "formatting": {
        "bold_ratio": 0.0,
        "mostly_bold": false,
        "max_font_size_pt": null
      },
      "list": {
        "is_list_item": false,
        "level": null,
        "num_id": null,
        "detected_from": null
      },
      "hyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Exceed your duty-free concession or Goods and Services Tax (GST) import relief",
      "formatting": {
        "bold_ratio": 0.0,
        "mostly_bold": false,
        "max_font_size_pt": null
      },
      "list": {
        "is_list_item": true,
        "level": 0,
        "num_id": 2,
        "detected_from": "paragraph"
      },
      "hyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Are dutiable, taxable, controlled, or prohibited",
      "formatting": {
        "bold_ratio": 0.0,
        "mostly_bold": false,
        "max_font_size_pt": null
      },
      "list": {
        "is_list_item": true,
        "level": 0,
        "num_id": 2,
        "detected_from": "paragraph"
      },
      "hyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Failing to declare or making an incorrect declaration is an offence under Singapore law. This includes under-declaring the value or quantity of goods, or failing to pay the relevant duty and/or GST.",
      "formatting": {
        "bold_ratio": 0.0,
        "mostly_bold": false,
        "max_font_size_pt": null
      },
      "list": {
        "is_list_item": false,
        "level": null,
        "num_id": null,
        "detected_from": null
      },
      "hyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Those found committing customs offences at the checkpoints may be offered the following composition amounts:",
      "formatting": {
        "bold_ratio": 0.0,
        "mostly_bold": false,
        "max_font_size_pt": null
      },
      "list": {
        "is_list_item": false,
        "level": null,
        "num_id": null,
        "detected_from": null
      },
      "hyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Composition Amounts for Checkpoints Offences",
      "formatting": {
        "bold_ratio": 0.0,
        "mostly_bold": false,
        "max_font_size_pt": null
      },
      "list": {
        "is_list_item": false,
        "level": null,
        "num_id": null,
