      },
      "hyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        [
          "Type of Offence",
          "Composition Amount*"
        ],
        [
          "Failure to declare or making an incorrect declaration of cigarettes",
          "1st offence: S$200 per packet or per 20 sticks or part thereof\n2nd offence: S$500 per packet or per 20 sticks or part thereof\n3rd offence: S$800 per packet or per 20 sticks or part thereof"
        ],
        [
          "Failure to declare or making an incorrect declaration of dutiable goods (excluding cigarettes)",
          "1st offence: 10 times the duty amount\n2nd offence: 15 times the duty amount\n3rd offence: 20 times the duty amount\nMinimum: S$50"
        ],
        [
          "Failure to declare or making an incorrect declaration of non-dutiable goods",
          "Up to 20 times the GST amount\nMinimum: S$50"
        ]
      ],
      "hyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "*Note: The composition amount will take into consideration the GST offence and is rounded down to the nearest S$5. The actual amount offered will be specified in the Notice of Customs Offence.",
      "formatting": {
        "bold_ratio": 0.0,
        "mostly_bold": false,
        "max_font_size_pt": null
      },
      "list": {
        "is_list_item": false,
        "level": null,
        "num_id": null,
        "detected_from": null
      },
      "hyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "If payment is delayed, offenders may be charged in court. For serious cases, or where the penalty exceeds S$5,000, offenders may also be prosecuted in court without any offer of composition.",
      "formatting": {
        "bold_ratio": 0.0,
        "mostly_bold": false,
        "max_font_size_pt": null
      },
      "list": {
        "is_list_item": false,
        "level": null,
        "num_id": null,
        "detected_from": null
      },
      "hyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "If you are unsure whether an item should be declared, use the Red Channel or approach a Customs officer for assistance.",
      "formatting": {
        "bold_ratio": 0.0,
        "mostly_bold": false,
        "max_font_size_pt": null
      },
      "list": {
        "is_list_item": false,
